From 8b24a63d4253e86de4e36b5e28066e4205cc1bf0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Suresh, Prashanth" <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 07:54:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] vpl-gpu-rt: Restore Android build glue excluded from 26.2.3
 overlay

The intel-onevpl-26.2.3 release tag doesn't carry the Android build
glue (Android.mk files throughout _studio/, android/Android.bp,
android/Android.mk, and the android/*.h and android/mfx_defs*.mk
config headers) -- those are a fork-local addition for the Android
build, deliberately excluded when overlaying the real upstream tag.
Restores them verbatim from the prior Android-tracking state.

This commit exists so the manifest can pin this project directly to
the real intel-onevpl-26.2.3 tag (2943e13f768add00b5391858e8fc193f6d22c40a)
instead of carrying the whole tag's tree as a single large patch --
only this Android-glue delta and the follow-on fixes layered on top of
it need to live in utils_vertical now.

Tracked-On: NIACP3-1547
Signed-off-by: Suresh, Prashanth <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
